      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c557829ccf1e27e3\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nNamely, it continued, “<strong>the immediate scene represented above is that where the Americans have thrown themselves into a hollow square</strong>,” this formation dating back to ancient Rome and employed in combat against cavalry units, ” with their ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c557829ccf1e27e3\">>>",
