      "title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"34e49515a0c18a75\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nBattle of San Gabriel, California | A Continent Divided: The U.S. Mexico War\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"34e49515a0c18a75\">>>",
