      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2b5cd8c45e0688a1\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe Americans came to the scene in a typical hollow square formation comprised of four divisions, including <strong>dragoons, an artillery company, mounted volunteers, Marines, musketeers and carabiners, and some Californios were included in the force</strong>.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2b5cd8c45e0688a1\">>>",
